values ('f6a7b8c9-0d1e-4f36-9a56-6b7c8d9e0f76', 'performance-management', 'Performance Management', 'A rigorous undergraduate HR course on designing, administering, and improving performance systems. Students learn how goals, competencies, feedback, coaching, appraisal, documentation, calibration, analytics, and legal safeguards work together to improve performance and employee development. This course provides a comprehensive foundation in designing, administering, and improving performance systems, with an emphasis on modern practices including coaching, continuous feedback, and equity.');

