m, not only an evaluation system.", "children": [{"id": "f11e02ed-675a-4e00-aeb7-4ee4c56ff15f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Individual development plans", "children": [{"id": "1fb668ea-5e27-45f5-b905-380c9f15aafc", "type": "concept", "title": "development objectives"}, {"id": "d708c3ba-426d-4acc-98db-c0d842e69a6a", "type": "concept", "title": "70-20-10 learning"}, {"id": "612b81d9-d782-4f66-a446-278c56dceede", "type": "concept", "title": "stretch assignments"}, {"id": "7e1b4619-f749-4203-9fed-bb9215539ce5", "type": "concept", "title": "mentoring"}, {"id": "147ade4b-7993-486d-a48f-746ce540e605", "type": "concept", "title": "learning metrics"}], "description": "Students learn how to turn performance evidence into realistic growth commitments."}, {"id": "ecc6a937-5f2f-4f41-ad3e-f035f1d30650", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Strengths-based performance", "children": [{"id": "b0eccb82-af57-4e71-bb73-adf376f692a9", "type": "concept", "title": "strengths assessment"}, {"id": "9105ab59-ff5a-4aa5-8627-8bc73678dc26", "type": "concept", "title": "job crafting"}, {"id": "3bb9d64b-fc38-4287-b9ec-c5250f1e23ec", "type": "concept", "title": "motivation"}, {"id": "e7d7bccf-8bfc-4205-be71-3f2794b0655a", "type": "concept", "title": "engagement"}, {"id": "231b6d07-2921-42f7-89c0-d59059f8001b", "type": "concept", "title": "role fit"}], "description": "The class explores how organizations can build on strengths while still addressing gaps."}, {"id": "bbdf8fb2-11cc-4575-8678-8db6d098e6e7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Talent reviews and succession", "children": [{"id": "704413f2-e0fd-4071-a3a6-df0828c0839c", "type": "concept", "title": "nine-box grids"}, {"id": "e02c5efe-6fc8-4218-a18b-e4003d06ec58", "type": "concept", "title": "potential"}, {"id": "6f954366-c5a7-4814-aeb1-2d993b268146", "type": "concept", "title": "readiness"}, {"id": "21bf182d-cea0-4549-8eb0-15bd9a9536ed", "type": "concept", "title": "succession slates"}, {"id": "2e4f6378-d40d-4ffe-9675-ceac9f69a2c8", "type": "concept"