s cautiously and ethically."}]}, {"id": "d59bb726-da0b-4615-9275-ea58de97a5a8", "type": "topic", "title": "Performance System Design and Implementation Case", "description": "The capstone topic asks students to synthesize strategy, forms, ratings, feedback, equity, technology, law, and change management into a practical system redesign.", "children": [{"id": "32915219-1bf8-4426-93d8-de3e352c917f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "System design choices", "children": [{"id": "87eec250-1f48-42e3-8e2d-251319a8046f", "type": "concept", "title": "design principles"}, {"id": "cbf430fe-d66b-4753-bb91-330a44195545", "type": "concept", "title": "rating versus no-rating"}, {"id": "43a3a4e2-3253-4544-9948-d8d80d7f2074", "type": "concept", "title": "cycle timing"}, {"id": "d7b6f68d-b691-4cd5-86d9-033dab703e09", "type": "concept", "title": "form design"}, {"id": "6be170ad-2805-4a69-be21-3f6a264312ac", "type": "concept", "title": "manager enablement"}], "description": "Students learn to select the right combination of goals, competencies, ratings, check-ins, calibration, and development tools."}, {"id": "acdd6b5f-1264-4639-a317-43494d9b4a15", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Implementation and communication", "children": [{"id": "eff8fb78-ebe6-4a02-af7b-7b2ddc59a1bf", "type": "concept", "title": "stakeholder analysis"}, {"id": "7858f514-0305-4b08-ad3a-4d5a694ba89e", "type": "concept", "title": "pilot testing"}, {"id": "82abe59c-3be5-4ca3-aba7-23f7c6613391", "type": "concept", "title": "training"}, {"id": "fecaeb21-8c96-43e3-aa5f-36ad0c569cd5", "type": "concept", "title": "communication plan"}, {"id": "20074ba1-7a9b-42ad-8203-e5b224994272", "type": "concept", "title": "manager toolkits"}], "description": "The course treats adoption as a change-management challenge, not a software rollout."}, {"id": "1d1a425f-fc8e-4b8a-b86c-a199bc07ec57", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evaluation and continuous improvement", "children": [{"id": "4c693e4e-0f0d-4a75-8ae8-2e2cfc5e8ff5", "type": "concept", "ti